# Example deployment target list for scripts/deploy-to-hosts.sh
#
# Copy this file to vm-hosts.conf and replace the placeholders with your own
# hosts. vm-hosts.conf is gitignored and must never be committed: it records
# real internal hostnames, which are not appropriate for a public repository.
#
# Format: one "<hostname> <ssh-user>" pair per line. Blank lines are skipped.
# Lines that do not contain both fields are skipped with a warning.
#
# The script copies the .deb to /tmp on each host, installs it with dpkg, then
# restarts the libvirt-volume-provisioner service. It needs passwordless sudo
# for dpkg and systemctl on the target hosts.

hypervisor-01.example.com provisioner
hypervisor-02.example.com provisioner